  "details": "I have 420+ uploaded avatars and growing.\n\nMy avatar favorites list with VRC+ is also maxed out, and I do use one tab to favorite my own favorite avatar uploads.\n\nI think it would be really convenient to be able to type the first 1-3 letters of an avatar I'm searching for to filter my own uploaded avatars based on the search criteria.\n\nSince all my avatars are uniquely named, that should be a nice way to filter my huge amount of uploads.\n\nAny other avatar creators got this problem? Q_Q",
